'''Catornado''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Oncoming Storm (Insane)|Oncoming Storm]]. [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] and increases health and movement speed. This unit is obtainable on the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch version]] after beating [[Andromeda (Cats of the Cosmos)|Andromeda]].

