==Trivia==
*Catornado technically has the second fastest attack rate of all Cats, as [[Trixi the Merc (Uber Rare Cat)|Trixi the Merc]] and [[Agent Staal (Uber Rare Cat)|Agent Staal]] attack three times in 17 frames while Catornado attacks 3 times in 18 frames. If not counting their [[Multi-Hit]] though, Catornado still has the fastest.
*The names of all of Catornado's forms are plays on the words for some types of severe weather, those being tornadoes, hurricanes and typhoons respectively.
*Since his Japanese description mentions an "amazing adventure that begins with blowing away a bus station in rain", the umbrella-holding cat and spinning top in Catyphoon are likely referencing Totoro from the Studio Ghibli film ''[[wikipedia:My Neighbor Totoro|My Neighbor Totoro]]''.
**The umbrella and spinning top could also be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Mary Poppins (film)|Mary Poppins]]''.
*The line "Karadajū ni kaze o atsumete arashi o makiokosu neko" ("A Cat that gathers the wind in his body and causes storms") in Catyphoon's Japanese description is a reference to the lyric "Karadajū ni kaze o atsumete makiokose arashi arashi" ("Gather the wind in your body and cause a storm, a storm") from "[https://youtu.be/evCrxxtslVU A • RA • SHI]", the first single by Japanese boy band [[wikipedia:Arashi|Arashi]].

